## CI policy (DND-2.3+)

```text
feature → develop
= local Sprint Final Quality Gate only (no GitHub CI required)

develop → master
= GitHub promote-gate + quality verification (required)
+ mandatory local full Playwright matrix (Chromium/Firefox/WebKit) before develop push

FX.6 established: GitHub does not reinstall browsers or rerun the 108-test matrix on promotion.
      Dispatch CI manually to run browser-e2e on GitHub.
```

